d 'cforest': Stata module for causal forests / generalized random forests
d
d Estimates the conditional average treatment effect (CATE) for a binary
d treatment using a causal forest, following Wager and Athey (2018) and
d Athey, Tibshirani and Wager (2019). Stage A drives econml.grf.CausalForest
d through Stata's Python integration; cforest_predict predicts CATE for new data.
d
d Author: Haoyu Niu
d Distribution-Date: 20261008
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
f cforest.ado
f cforest.sthlp
f cforest.py
f cforest_predict.ado
f cforest_predict.sthlp
f cforest_predict.py
